    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33918" root="فشأ" body-key="f">
    
      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تفشّأ</span></b>  <i>It</i> (a thing) <i>spread.</i> (S, O.) One says
of a disease, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تفشّأبِهِمْ</span>, (AZ, S, O,) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِيهِمْ</span>, (K,)
[and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تفشّى</span>, and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تفسّأ</span>,] <i>It spread among them:</i>
(AZ, S, O, K:) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تفشّأهم</span> <i>it became common,</i>
or <i>general,</i> or <i>universal, among them.</i> (O.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تفشّأ بِهِ</span> <i>He mocked at him,</i> or <i>derided him.</i>
(O, K.) 

